            <ArticleTitle>[The usefulness of ultrasonography in the diagnosis of pain caused by extensor knee apparatus' lesions].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>39-42</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The aim of this work was to present our experience in using ultrasonography in the diagnostics of knee pain. In spite of some limitations of this method of examination it can be successfully used to obtain more accurate diagnosis of the extensor knee apparatus lesions.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
